{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/planner/1/manifest.json",
    "title": "规划角色运行清单",
    "summary": "清单声明 planner v1 的配置组合：角色档案、内联技能、输出合同、无工具会话隔离和预算。它描述宿主应如何装载角色，但不等同于运行成功或规划能力已通过测试。",
    "category": "configuration",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "assembly",
        "title": "角色装配与输出合同",
        "body": "该清单把角色标识设为 planner、版本设为 1，并引用 `traex` profile 与 `prompt.md`。[[c1]] 它内联装载版本为 `plan-1` 的任务规划技能，同时记录制品摘要；预期输出合同为 PlanProposal.v1。摘要可用于绑定特定技能制品，但材料没有展示宿主如何核验摘要。[[c2]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "isolation",
        "title": "权限、会话与预算",
        "body": "工具策略为 `none` 且允许工具列表为空，意味着此角色按配置只能提出计划，不能借助工具执行步骤。[[c3]] 会话不复用，也不继承用户技能或 MCP，体现任务间隔离。预算上限声明为 96,000 个上下文 token、24,000 个输出 token，并允许最多两次修复；这些是配置额度，不是实际消耗或成功率记录。[[c4]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "规划角色基础身份配置",
        "reason": "支持角色版本、profile 与提示模板来源的说明。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/planner/1/manifest.json",
          "startLine": 2,
          "endLine": 8
        },
        "quote": "  \"schema_version\": 1,\n  \"role_id\": \"planner\",\n  \"role_version\": \"1\",\n  \"profile_ref\": \"traex\",\n  \"prompt_templates\": [\n    \"prompt.md\"\n  ],"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "内联技能与输出合同配置",
        "reason": "支持技能版本、装载方式、制品摘要及 PlanProposal.v1 输出声明。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/planner/1/manifest.json",
          "startLine": 9,
          "endLine": 17
        },
        "quote": "  \"skill_bundles\": [\n    {\n      \"canonical_name\": \"omem-task-planning\",\n      \"version\": \"plan-1\",\n      \"load_mode\": \"inline\",\n      \"artifact_digest\": \"33a0030d26e3ac637de650b9e58f8c89e578e4c5b3c05471c5247f3c6db4bc3c\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"output_schema\": \"PlanProposal.v1\","
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "无工具策略",
        "reason": "支持 planner 配置上不能调用工具执行计划的判断。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/planner/1/manifest.json",
          "startLine": 18,
          "endLine": 21
        },
        "quote": "  \"tool_policy\": {\n    \"mode\": \"none\",\n    \"allowed_tools\": []\n  },"
      },
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "会话隔离与预算配置",
        "reason": "支持会话不复用、不继承用户能力以及 token 和修复次数上限的说明。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/planner/1/manifest.json",
          "startLine": 22,
          "endLine": 30
        },
        "quote": "  \"session_policy\": {\n    \"reuse\": \"never\",\n    \"inherit_user_skills\": false,\n    \"inherit_user_mcp\": false\n  },\n  \"budget\": {\n    \"max_context_tokens\": 96000,\n    \"max_output_tokens\": 24000,\n    \"max_repair_attempts\": 2"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "宿主是否会验证技能制品摘要，并拒绝摘要不匹配或不支持的 profile？",
        "why": "清单给出了摘要和 profile 引用，却没有宿主装载逻辑、失败策略或集成测试，不能从声明推断校验已实施。",
        "nextStep": "检查角色装载器及其测试，确认摘要校验、profile 解析和失败行为。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c1",
          "c2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "question": "这些 token 上限与最多两次修复在实际 ACP/模型运行中如何计量和强制？",
        "why": "材料仅给出静态预算值，没有运行 trace 或越界测试。",
        "nextStep": "补充预算执行代码、越界用例和包含实际用量的运行 trace。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c4"
        ]
      }
    ]
